# Frontend

- Compose standard controls from `src/components/ui/` (shadcn `base-nova`).
  Do not hand-roll a second button / tab / dialog / menu / card / sheet / tooltip / skeleton.
- Canvas mechanics with no shadcn equivalent stay in React Flow + domain code
  (`src/components/CanvasFlow.tsx`, `src/store/flowStore.ts`), but visible
  standard controls inside them still use shadcn primitives.
- Theme source of truth is `data-theme` + `--gc-*` variables in `src/index.css`.
- Present behavior + layout proposal and wait for explicit confirmation
  before editing UI or interaction code. Read-only audits need no confirmation.
- Keep keyboard operation, visible focus, accessible names, reduced-motion,
  and focus restoration for every changed interaction.
- `ProjectTab[]` is the canonical document source. UI panel open/closed state,
  selection, viewer/compare state, and React Flow measurements stay out of
  document history and session persistence.
